From 6e9cf472d546fa35b0420b1147962dc374c2f579 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 4 Apr 2026 07:34:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: overhaul Parts Used system with quantity tracking,
 smart suggestions & restock
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Models:
- UsedPartLine: redesigned as serializable data class with Name, Sku, Quantity,
  UnitPrice, IsCustom, IsOutOfStock/IsLowStock flags, and DeductedQtyInSession
  for session-aware restocking
- PartSuggestionItem: new model for suggestion dropdown carrying stock level,
  price, source (Parts/Inventory) and computed display helpers

Data layer:
- PartsRepository: add RestoreQuantityBySku / RestoreQuantityBySkuAsync
- InventoryRepository: add RestoreQuantityByName / RestoreQuantityByNameAsync

ViewModel (RepairTicketsViewModel):
- Replace flat string list with ObservableCollection<UsedPartLine>
- Parts catalog built from full PartModel/InventoryItemModel data (stock, price)
- Smart suggestion ranking: prefix match > in-stock > alphabetical
- Suggestions show up to 10 results (was 8 strings)
- AddPartFromSuggestion: increments qty on existing chip instead of ignoring
- AddPartByName: custom part creation with ⚠ badge
- IncrementPart / DecrementPart: per-unit stock deduction/restoration
- RemovePart: restores DeductedQtyInSession units to stock on remove
- JSON format upgraded to compact DTO [{n,s,q,p,c}]; full backward compat
  with old string-array format (duplicates collapsed into qty)
- Keyboard navigation: ↑↓ to navigate suggestions, Enter/Tab to add, Esc close
- AcceptSuggestion command for Tab key
- CloseSuggestions command for Escape key
- Async ticket loading with IsLoading flag

XAML (RepairTicketsView):
